{"text": "utilize", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\">utiliser</i>, from Italian <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\">utilizzare</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"it\">utile</i> (\u201cuseful\u201d), from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">\u016btilis</i>, from <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">\u016bt\u012b</i> (\u201cuse\u201d).\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Verb", "definitions": [{"definition": "(US, Canada, Oxford British English) Alternative spelling of utilise.", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["UK", "/\u02c8ju\u02d0.t\u026a.la\u026az/"], ["General Australian", "/\u02c8j\u0289\u02d0.t\u0259.l\u0251\u026az/"], ["US, Canada", "/\u02c8ju.t\u0259.la\u026az/"]]}